# Relay runtime state, written next to server/ when it runs. Never commit these: sessions.json
# in particular holds live player and wallet data, and this repo is public. progress.json and
# callsigns.json were already listed; the rest were not, so a local relay run left four
# untracked state files sitting one `git add .` away from being published.
progress.json
callsigns.json
claimed-anon.json
sessions.json
marketplace.json
pvp-kills.json
docs/superpowers/
.env*

# Social showcase capture artifacts (video/poster) — too big for git, generate locally
public/social/*.mp4
public/social/*-poster.png

# Gameplay screenshot captures (scripts/capture-gameplay.mjs) — large PNGs regenerated on demand
# for before/after comparisons, not meant to be tracked in history.
docs/screenshots/
